{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は花奈と一緒に生駒が出演している\n舞台「こち亀」を観に行ってきました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/12/0741161/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(残念ながら写真が撮れなかったので\n花奈との、ちょっと前の写真◎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで一番笑った舞台でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技も歌もダンスもボケもツッコミも\n全てが素晴らしくて\nずっとにやにや笑いながら観てました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白すぎて本当びっくり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心が豊かになるような\nとっても楽しい舞台をありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして生駒、とっても素敵でした( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブもあった中でこんな短期間で\n演技や歌を完成させて、\nそれでいてそんな大変そうな素振りも見せず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台上での楽しそうな姿や全力の姿が\n本当にカッコよかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カッコよかったし\n物凄く可愛かったよ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌もソロで歌うのは内心緊張してたと思うけど\nそんな風に聞こえず、堂々とした歌声でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音もズレてなかったし\n生駒の歌の癖が歌詞や雰囲気に合ってて\nとってもよかった( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ続く舞台頑張ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してる(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、観に行ってない皆さん、\n是非観に行った方がいいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観た後、観にきてよかったなって\n心から思えるので(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちは\"食\"散歩！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は舞台観終わりに、\n花奈とマネージャーと3人、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しい！と声が揃った\nソフトクリームを紹介します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白一さんの珈琲牛乳(ソフトクリーム)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/12/0741161/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珈琲牛乳の中に\nソフトクリームが入っている\nシンプルな飲み物なのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソフトクリームはトロトロせず\n固めなので暫く溶けないので\nしっかり最後まで食べられます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして珈琲牛乳なので甘い珈琲で\nとっても飲みやすく\nソフトクリームと相性がいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びよーんと伸びてるソフトクリーム\nずっと気になってたので\n今日行けてよかった！( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生アイス、美味しかった( ;o; )\nまた食べたい( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は普通のコーンのソフトクリーム狙いで\n行こうと思います( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈はまた別の食べてた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そちらも美味しそうでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「赤黄色の金木犀」フジファブリックさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋が待ち遠しくなる曲。\n私、金木犀の香りが大好きで\n香水があれば欲しい！\nと思ってしまうほど。\nなのでこの曲の金木犀の香りがしてきそうな\n柔らかい雰囲気が大好き。\n金木犀の香り嗅ぎたくなる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/12/0741161/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は足がパンパンだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂にゆっくり入ってから\n眠ります(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}